#: include/admin-interfaces/security-scan/scan_item_php_register_globals.php:32
msgid ""
"When register_globals is enabled, PHP will automatically create variables in the "
"global scope for any value passed in GET, POST or COOKIE. This, combined with the "
"use of variables without initialization, has led to numerous security "
"vulnerabilities."
msgstr ""
"Quando register_globals está ativado, o PHP criará automaticamente variáveis no "
"âmbito global para qualquer valor passado em GET, POST ou COOKIE. Isto, combinado "
"com o uso de variáveis sem inicialização, levou a numerosas vulnerabilidades de "
"segurança."

#: include/admin-interfaces/security-scan/scan_item_php_register_globals.php:48
msgid ""
"<span class=\"dashicons dashicons-no\"></span>The register_globals is ON. \n"
"                                                                        To fix "
"this security issue, change the php.ini:\n"
"\n"
"                                                                        <br /"
"><code>register_globals = \"off\"</code>\n"
"\n"
"                                                                        <br />or "
"within .htaccess:\n"
"\n"
"                                                                        <br /"
"><code>php_flag register_globals off</code>."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"dashicons dashicons-no\"></span>O register_globals está LIGADO. \n"
"                                                                        Para "
"corrigir este problema de segurança, altere o php.ini:\n"
"\n"
"                                                                        <br /"
"><code>register_globals = \"off\"</code>\n"
"\n"
"                                                                        <br />ou "
"dentro de .htaccess:\n"
"\n"
"                                                                        <br /"
"><code>php_flag register_globals off</code>."

#: include/admin-interfaces/security-scan/scan_item_php_register_globals.php:64
msgid "<span class=\"dashicons dashicons-yes\"></span>The register_globals is Off."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"dashicons dashicons-yes\"></span>O register_globals está Desligado."

#: include/admin-interfaces/security-scan/scan_item_php_safe_mode.php:32
msgid ""
"The PHP safe mode is an attempt to solve the shared-server security problem. It "
"is architecturally incorrect to try to solve this problem at the PHP level, but "
"since the alternatives at the web server and OS levels aren't very realistic, "
"many people, especially ISP's, use safe mode for now."
msgstr ""
"O modo seguro do PHP é uma tentativa de resolver o problema de segurança de "
"servidor partilhado. É arquitetonicamente incorreto tentar resolver este problema "
"ao nível do PHP, mas uma vez que as alternativas ao nível do servidor web e SO "
"não são muito realistas, muitas pessoas, especialmente ISPs, usam o modo seguro "
"por agora."

#: include/admin-interfaces/security-scan/scan_item_php_safe_mode.php:48
msgid ""
"<span class=\"dashicons dashicons-no\"></span>The register_globals is ON. \n"
"                                                                        To fix "
"this security issue, change the php.ini:\n"
"\n"
"                                                                        <br /"
"><code>safe_mode = \"off\"</code>\n"
"\n"
"                                                                        <br />or "
"within .htaccess:\n"
"\n"
"                                                                        <br /"
"><code>php_flag safe_mode off</code>."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"dashicons dashicons-no\"></span>O register_globals está LIGADO. \n"
"                                                                        Para "
"corrigir este problema de segurança, altere o php.ini:\n"
"\n"
"                                                                        <br /"
"><code>safe_mode = \"off\"</code>\n"
"\n"
"                                                                        <br />ou "
"dentro de .htaccess:\n"
"\n"
"                                                                        <br /"
"><code>php_flag safe_mode off</code>."

#: include/admin-interfaces/security-scan/scan_item_php_safe_mode.php:64
msgid "<span class=\"dashicons dashicons-yes\"></span>The safe_mode is Off."
msgstr "<span class=\"dashicons dashicons-yes\"></span>O safe_mode está Desligado."

#: include/admin-interfaces/security-scan/scan_item_php_version.php:29
msgid "PHP Version"
msgstr "Versão PHP"

#: include/admin-interfaces/security-scan/scan_item_php_version.php:32
msgid ""
"Using the latest PHP version ensures the longevity of security updates. While "
"older versions of PHP offer security updates for a time past “end of life,” the "
"most secure option is the version that is actively maintained."
msgstr ""
"Usar a versão mais recente do PHP garante a longevidade das atualizações de "
"segurança. Enquanto versões mais antigas do PHP oferecem atualizações de "
"segurança por um tempo após o 'fim de vida', a opção mais segura é a versão que "
"está ativamente mantida."

#: include/admin-interfaces/security-scan/scan_item_unwanted_files.php:29
