#: modules/components/firewall-query-string.php:61
msgid ""
"The arguments of an URL are the typical way for hackers to attempt to break into "
"a server. This firewall gives your site a super strong layer of protection at the "
"server level. So bad requests are blocked without having to load up PHP, MySQL, "
"and everything else."
