#: modules/components/general-js-combine.php:229
msgid "Use only script name e.g. mediaelement-and-player.min.js, one per row."
msgstr ""
"Use apenas o nome do script, por exemplo: mediaelement-and-player.min.js, um por "
"linha."

#: modules/components/general-js-combine.php:230
msgid ""
"Excluding from Combine and using Replacements, there will be no substitutions on "
