#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:50
msgid ""
"The HTTP Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only response header allows web "
"developers to experiment with Content-Security-Policy policies by monitoring (but "
"not enforcing) their effects. These violation reports consist of JSON documents "
"sent via an HTTP POST request to the specified URI."
