msgid "Content-Security-Policy"
msgstr "Content-Security-Policy"

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:50
msgid ""
"The HTTP Content-Security-Policy response header allows web site administrators "
"to control resources the user agent is allowed to load for a given page. With a "
"few exceptions, policies mostly involve specifying server origins and script "
"endpoints. This helps guard against cross-site scripting attacks (Cross-"
"site_scripting)."
msgstr ""
"O cabeçalho de resposta HTTP Content-Security-Policy permite que os "
"administradores de sites controlem os recursos que o user agent tem permissão "
"para carregar para uma determinada página. Com algumas exceções, as políticas "
"envolvem principalmente a especificação de origens do servidor e endpoints de "
"script. Isto ajuda a proteger contra ataques de cross-site scripting (Cross-"
"site_scripting)."

#: modules/components/security-header-cross-origin-embedder-policy.php:47
msgid "Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy (COEP)"
msgstr "Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy (COEP)"

#: modules/components/security-header-cross-origin-embedder-policy.php:50
msgid "Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy"
msgstr "Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy"

#: modules/components/security-header-cross-origin-embedder-policy.php:51
msgid ""
"The HTTP Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy (COEP) response header prevents a document "
"from loading any cross-origin resources that don't explicitly grant the document "
"permission (using CORP or CORS)."
msgstr ""
"O cabeçalho de resposta HTTP Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy (COEP) impede que um "
"documento carregue quaisquer recursos cross-origin que não concedam "
"explicitamente permissão ao documento (usando CORP ou CORS)."

#: modules/components/security-header-cross-origin-embedder-policy.php:52
#: modules/components/security-header-cross-origin-opener-policy.php:53
#: modules/components/security-header-cross-origin-resource-policy.php:51
#: modules/components/security-header-referrer-policy.php:52
#: modules/components/security-header-stricy-transport-security.php:52
#: modules/components/security-header-x-content-type-options.php:53
#: modules/components/security-header-x-frame-options.php:52
#: modules/components/security-header-x-permitted-cross-domain-policies.php:54
#: modules/components/security-header-x-xss-protection.php:52
msgid "Options:"
msgstr "Opções:"

#: modules/components/security-header-cross-origin-embedder-policy.php:53
msgid ""
"This is the default value. Allows the document to fetch cross-origin resources "
"without giving explicit permission through the CORS protocol or the Cross-Origin-"
"Resource-Policy header."
msgstr ""
"Este é o valor predefinido. Permite que o documento obtenha recursos cross-origin "
"sem dar permissão explícita através do protocolo CORS ou do cabeçalho Cross-"
"Origin-Resource-Policy."

#: modules/components/security-header-cross-origin-embedder-policy.php:54
msgid ""
"A document can only load resources from the same origin, or resources explicitly "
"marked as loadable from another origin. If a cross origin resource supports CORS, "
"the crossorigin attribute or the Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy header must be used "
"to load it without being blocked by COEP."
msgstr ""
"Um documento só pode carregar recursos da mesma origem, ou recursos "
"explicitamente marcados como carregáveis de outra origem. Se um recurso cross "
"origin suportar CORS, o atributo crossorigin ou o cabeçalho Cross-Origin-Resource-"
"Policy deve ser usado para o carregar sem ser bloqueado pelo COEP."

#: modules/components/security-header-cross-origin-embedder-policy.php:104
#: modules/components/security-header-cross-origin-opener-policy.php:108
